# Deep2 Qwen32 40TPS — Batch 4/5, item 18
# Base: apply after 0016-0017 and Batch 2 grouped row split.
#
# Goal: Q/K/V and gate/up groups use one submit PER GPU for the entire group:
# input copy -> GEMV0 -> output0 copy -> GEMV1 -> output1 copy -> ...
#
# This cuts warm steady-state queue waits:
#   QKV:    6 GPU submits -> 2
#   GateUp: 4 GPU submits -> 2
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0018_group_single_submit_qkv_gateup.patch

